{"unit_id":"NewSpringWei__dsh-biz-bridge#card-zh","repo":"NewSpringWei/dsh-biz-bridge","commit":"51d5ba059209a3f617a5b4083a374da9e499c04c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-biz-bridge 是面向业务系统的 DSH HTTP 桥接插件，可将 DSH agent 能力通过带签名认证的 HTTP API 提供给外部业务客户端。它注册 /bizbridge 路由，支持 SSE 流式应答和异步回调任务，并以 session_id 复用多轮会话。插件还提供任务查询、取消、重播、优先级管理、模型目录与 provider 配置接口，以及入站附件提交和出站文件登记下载。任务状态与日志存入 SQLite，各 client 使用独立工作区。适合需要从业务后端调用 DSH agent、跟踪长任务并交换文件的集成场景；业务方需配置公钥并签名请求。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:210","src/http/http-api.ts:1","src/core/attachment-flow.ts:36"]}
{"unit_id":"NewSpringWei__dsh-biz-bridge#card-en","repo":"NewSpringWei/dsh-biz-bridge","commit":"51d5ba059209a3f617a5b4083a374da9e499c04c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-biz-bridge connects business services to DSH agents over signed HTTP. It offers SSE streaming, queued callbacks, session reuse, task controls, model configuration, and two-way file transfer. It stores task data in SQLite and separates client workspaces.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:210","src/http/http-api.ts:1","src/core/attachment-flow.ts:36"]}
